/* Netlify Redirects for SPAs */
/* Redirect all requests to index.html so React Router can handle them */
/* This prevents 404 errors on page refresh */
/* https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/rewrites-proxies/#history-pushstate-and-single-page-apps */

/*
  Usage:
  1. Create a file named '_redirects' in your 'public' folder.
  2. Add the following line:
*/

/*
/*  /index.html  200
*/
